create_particles    O n 0 twopass
Created 9000 particles
  CPU time = 0.00304317 secs

compute temp thermal/grid all all temp
compute trot grid all all trot

compute tvib_O2 tvib/grid all O2

compute red_temp reduce ave c_temp[*]
compute red_trot reduce ave c_trot[*]

compute red_tvib_O2 reduce ave c_tvib_O2[*]

compute	nrho_O2 grid all O2 nrho
compute	nrho_O grid all O nrho

compute red_nrho_O2 reduce ave c_nrho_O2[*]
compute red_nrho_O reduce ave c_nrho_O[*]

compute	n_O2 grid all O2 n
compute	n_O grid all O n

compute red_n_O2 reduce ave c_n_O2[*]
compute red_n_O reduce ave c_n_O[*]

compute ke grid all species ke
compute erot grid all species erot
compute evib grid all species evib

compute red_ke reduce ave c_ke[*]
compute red_erot reduce ave c_erot[*]
compute red_evib reduce ave c_evib[*]

